<%# Signed-in preview bar (spec §6.4, round 3 handoff C40): PreviewController
    is the only place that sets @preview_record, so this only ever renders
    there: the layout renders it at the very top of <body>, outside the
    theme's frame, and no theme replaces it. The
    bar itself is `Public::PreviewBarComponent`. %>
<%= render Public::PreviewBarComponent.new(record: @preview_record, locale: I18n.locale) %>
